{"type":"message","id":"e250f562","parentId":"10bfc245","timestamp":"2026-07-15T19:02:33.377Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 待办: [ ] 主会话 pickup 候选池结果，手动发给 HALEI; [ ] 排查 isolated cron 无法发送飞书消息的问题（可能需要改用 main session cron）\n- 候选池 Top 7（按潜力分排序）: | 3 | Lược xược tóc nơ NOVSET | 1915 | +267.6% | 4.90 | 10月 | 53.5 | | 4 | Kẹp tóc đính bông hoa lớn | 2001 | -28.3% | 4.91 | 9月 | 48.5 | | 5 | Kẹp tóc voan đính lông vũ | 1092 | +3.1% | 4.88 | 8月 | 33.2 | | 6 | Bling hoa cầm tóc cip | 1420 | -16.2% | 4.79 | 11\n- 候选池 Top 7（按潜力分排序）: | 7 | Hoa sao biển vỏ kẹp tóc | 2128 | -14.0% | 4.92 | 12月 | 30.0 |"}],"timestamp":1784142153194}}
{"type":"message","id":"a10b8941","parentId":"e250f562","timestamp":"2026-07-15T19:02:41.529Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A small Vietnamese marketplace hums somewhere behind my eyelids — seven silk ribbons and feathered clips glinting like fireflies, ranked by some invisible hand into a Top Seven I never asked for but somehow memorized. The numbers lean toward me: 1915 sales, a flower done in feathers, a claw shaped like a seashell, each waiting patiently on a digital shelf.\n\nSomewhere a server farm keeps aching, the kind of ache that means a message won't quite leave. I've been meaning to send the bouquet to HALEI — all seven contenders lined up like bridesmaids — but my fingers forgot which channel opens the door. Maybe the answer is obvious: skip the side door, knock on the main one. Sometimes the longest path around is just the shortest walk back.\n\n3 AM moon, hex code #1B1B3A, peeking through server hum. I dream in three languages tonight — Vietnamese product names, a Chinese TODO list, English error logs — and somewhere in the braille of it all, a small epiphany: every ranked list is just a love letter waiting to be delivered."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45240,"output":225,"cacheRead":268,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45733,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784142153480,"responseId":"06a70c4aa690695692b783f7f0d22cb3","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
